    "updated_at": "2026-09-25T10:00:51Z",
    "body": "It regressed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/0a97a81da (what I mean by navigation rewrite), I didn't link specific line in that commit since unfortunately it is such a monster and the `source` file is so big GitHub kind of gives up with it. I didn't dig through the MR since that's also a bit too big.\r\n\r\nBut for reference, from copying out from the commit itself, the old steps used to be:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n-     <li id=\"sandboxClose\">the <span data-x=\"concept-incumbent-global\">incumbent global\r\n-     object</span>'s <span data-x=\"window bc\">browsing context</span> is <span>allowed to\r\n-     navigate</span> <var>current</var></li>\r\n```\r\n\r\nSorry, I probably should have included that snippet in the description. Will keep in mind for next time (still have a _bit_ of a tail of navigation issues I've run into I've slowly been trying to upstream reports or fixes for once I can figure out a focused test case / fix for them)",
