    "body": "> @zcorpan if the above looks okay to you too I think this can be merged now? Though we should probably include the commit reference in the final commit message.\n\nYes. Before 0a97a81da, \"allowed to navigate\" used the incumbent browsing context's active document's sandboxing flags, and 0a97a81da snapshotted the target's active document instead.\n\nAI review found no issues.\n\n<details><summary>Reviewed commits</summary>\n\nReviewed at 01aa00c on d78d7dd, with web-platform-tests/wpt#62903 at 5351e18, using spec-pr-review.\n</details>\n",
